        ['Palmistry (Hastarekha)', 'Understand your innate character, life line, fate line, potential health indications and natural strengths.']
      ],
      serviceLink: 'Explore this service →',
      experienceEyebrow: 'A CLEAR CONSULTATION EXPERIENCE', experienceTitle: 'Personal guidance, without unnecessary complexity.',
